WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Dhalsim’s standing heavy kick hits Ryu during recovery from a missed reversal.

2
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.100
Dhalsim crouches into the heavy-punch follow-up while Ryu reels from the punish counter.

3
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.650
Heavy Yoga Blast launches Ryu after the crouching heavy punch.

4
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:02.850
Ryu falls to the floor after the heavy-Blast finish.
